  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集说到一九六零年，四十二岁的程开甲留下一句，我要出趟远差，从学术界彻底消失了。三年后，他出现在了罗布泊那地方叫死亡之海。白天热的像蒸笼，地表温度能烤鸡蛋，晚上冷的像冰窖，裹着棉被还打哆嗦。裹的水是苦咸的正的，吃的，馒头里能嚼出沙子，没有先进计算机，没有现成参考资料，连一块像样的黑板都得自己往墙上装成开甲。就在这儿开始了中国第一颗原子弹的研制，他在家里装一块黑板，办公室装一块搬家的时候，专门留一面墙装黑板。这块黑板就是他的武器库，每一道粉笔演算都是在黑暗里摸下，像光明的脚印。很快，一个巨大的争论摆在了所有人面前。当时高层倾向于用飞机投掷，觉得更接近实战。但陈开甲在黑板上反复推演后，拍了桌子不行，必须用百米高塔爆炸。他的理由很简单，飞机投掷偏差太大，一旦数据采集失败，几年，心血全白费。国家这么穷，做一次试验不容易，每一个数据都得拿命去换，容不得半点闪失。争论最激烈的时候，他敢跟基地司令员当面拍桌子，有人劝他，领导都定了，你叫什么？真陈开甲说，我不管他是不是司令员，我只看他讲不讲科学，我是怕国家的事业在我手里出半分差错，最终高层采纳了他的方案。一百零二米高，铁塔爆炸。一九六四年十月十六日，罗布泊上空一声巨响，蘑菇云腾空而起。因为坚持了塔报方案，程开甲带队研制的一千七百多台测试仪器全部拿到了完整数据。这个成果有多牛？法国第一次核试验没拿到任何数据，美国、英国苏联第一次也只拿到很少一部分。而中国第一次就全部拿到了蘑菇云升起来的那一刻，所有人都在欢呼。陈开甲笑了，但他的脑子没停下来，气还没喘匀，他又扎进了清弹的研究里。说到这儿，我得给你讲个小插曲，你就知道这个人疯到什么程度。有一次在研究所食堂排队打饭，轮到城开甲了，他把饭票递进窗口，眼睛直勾勾盯着师傅手里的勺子，嘴里一本正经的说，我给你这个数据，你验算一下。食堂师傅拿着饭票愣在那儿，一脸蒙圈儿排在后面的邓稼先实在忍不住了，扑哧一声笑出来，拍着他的肩膀说，老城这儿是食堂程开甲，这才如梦初醒，不好意思的挠头道歉，这不是段子，这是真事儿，一个把自己活成了数据的人，你说他疯不疯？但真正让所有人红了眼眶的是另一件事。一次地下河试验爆炸成功后，众人欢呼雀跃的时候，程开甲做了一个让所有人都吓傻的决定，他要亲自钻进爆炸中心的坑道，收集第一手资料。那条坑道被核爆的冲击力挤压到直径不到八十厘米，刚报答完，里面全是致命的放射性危害探测笔一直在响，警报声刺耳，而且坑道随时可能坍塌。身边的人都急了，手掌您不能去，太危险了。我们年轻人去陈凯甲一把拦住他们，只说了八个字，不入虎穴焉得虎子。说完，他穿上防护服，第一个钻进了那条不到八十厘米宽的坑道，在高温、高放射性随时可能坍塌的坑道里匍匐前进，一步一步爬向爆炸。中心出来的时候，他浑身是汗，脸上全是灰。警卫员问他，首长，您不怕吗？嗯，程铠甲淡定的说，怕。但我更怕祖国的试验有什么闪失？这句话比任何豪言壮语都重在罗布泊的。二十多年里，程开甲参与主持了三十多次核试验，从原子弹到氢弹，从地面爆炸到地下数井。每一次都很成功，他被称为中国核试令，是中国参与核试验次数最多的科学家。可你知道吗？这二十多年里，他把生活的重担全留给了妻子高耀山。他穿着带补丁的旧军衣，扛着铁锹和家属们一起开荒种地，种萝卜、土豆、大白菜，把家里的事儿全包了让程开甲一门心思搞实验，而他满脑子都是数据，连妻子什么时候白了头都没注意到。直到一九九九年，国家授予二十三名科学家两弹一星功勋奖章，隐姓埋名四十年的陈开家，这个名字才重新出现在公众面前。人们这才知道，这位满头白发的老人，是中国唯一一位及其六大最高荣誉的科学家。中国科学院院士、两弹一星功勋奖章、国家最高科学技术奖八一勋章改革先锋称号，人民科学家、国家荣誉称号六大荣誉，给予一人之身，前无古人。二零一八年十一月十七日，程凯甲病逝，享年一百零一岁。他来的时候，中国山河破碎，被人看不起。他走的时候，中国国富民强，再也没人敢随便欺负。程老。生前说过一句话，我这辈子最大的幸福就是自己所做的一切都和祖国紧紧的联系在一起。他本可以留在英国，穿着西装，喝着咖啡走学术的坦途，但他选择了在大漠里喝风吃沙，隐姓埋名四十年。他本可以名扬四海享受鲜花和掌声，但他选择了把名字埋进黄沙，连家人都不知道他在干什么。有人说他傻，可正是这种傻，撑起了我们今天的腰杆子。我们今天能安安稳稳坐在家里看手机，吃饭睡觉，不用看别人脸色，不用怕别人的军舰开到家门口，有多少是程开甲和他的战友们拿命换来的。记住这个名字，程开甲，中国核司令共和国的脊梁。说到这儿，我想多说一句，程开甲只是千千万万国事中的一个，那些把名字埋进黄沙，拿命换国家安定的人。他们的故事真的不该被遗忘。这套国之脊梁里面写了包括程开甲在内的四十多位中国科学家的真实人生。不是那种喊口号的人物简介，是真的把他们受的苦冒的险做的选择一装一件写出来了。我自己看的时候，好几次没忍住眼泪，尤其是家里有孩子的真，该让孩子读读，在大漠里，在实验室里，在生死线上拿命给我们铺路的人。书就在视频左下角链接里，感兴趣的朋友可以带回家，细细品读。如果你也被程老的故事打动了，请点个赞，把这条视频转发出去，让更多人知道谁才是我们最该追的星。评论区告诉我，程老的哪个瞬间最戳你的心？收藏起来，讲给你的孩子，听关注我。下一期继续讲，那些不该被遗忘的国事。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 4190,
      "text": "上集说到一九六零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4230,
      "end_ms": 6610,
      "text": "四十二岁的程开甲留下一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6610,
      "end_ms": 8010,
      "text": "我要出趟远差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8650,
      "end_ms": 11010,
      "text": "从学术界彻底消失了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00005",
      "start_ms": 12350,
      "end_ms": 13110,
      "text": "三年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13450,
      "end_ms": 17490,
      "text": "他出现在了罗布泊那地方叫死亡之海。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00007",
      "start_ms": 18030,
      "end_ms": 19650,
      "text": "白天热的像蒸笼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00008",
      "start_ms": 20190,
      "end_ms": 22410,
      "text": "地表温度能烤鸡蛋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00009",
      "start_ms": 23030,
      "end_ms": 24630,
      "text": "晚上冷的像冰窖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00010",
      "start_ms": 25070,
      "end_ms": 27150,
      "text": "裹着棉被还打哆嗦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00011",
      "start_ms": 27950,
      "end_ms": 30000,
      "text": "裹的水是苦咸的正的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00012",
      "start_ms": 30060,
      "end_ms": 30340,
      "text": "吃的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00013",
      "start_ms": 30340,
      "end_ms": 32020,
      "text": "馒头里能嚼出沙子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00014",
      "start_ms": 32420,
      "end_ms": 33820,
      "text": "没有先进计算机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00015",
      "start_ms": 34040,
      "end_ms": 35560,
      "text": "没有现成参考资料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00016",
      "start_ms": 35800,
      "end_ms": 39800,
      "text": "连一块像样的黑板都得自己往墙上装成开甲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00017",
      "start_ms": 39800,
      "end_ms": 44420,
      "text": "就在这儿开始了中国第一颗原子弹的研制，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00018",
      "start_ms": 45180,
      "end_ms": 46740,
      "text": "他在家里装一块黑板，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00019",
      "start_ms": 47440,
      "end_ms": 50700,
      "text": "办公室装一块搬家的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00020",
      "start_ms": 50700,
      "end_ms": 52800,
      "text": "专门留一面墙装黑板。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00021",
      "start_ms": 53280,
      "end_ms": 55780,
      "text": "这块黑板就是他的武器库，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00022",
      "start_ms": 56500,
      "end_ms": 60010,
      "text": "每一道粉笔演算都是在黑暗里摸下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00023",
      "start_ms": 60050,
      "end_ms": 61210,
      "text": "像光明的脚印。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00024",
      "start_ms": 61590,
      "end_ms": 62235,
      "text": "很快，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00025",
      "start_ms": 62670,
      "end_ms": 65775,
      "text": "一个巨大的争论摆在了所有人面前。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00026",
      "start_ms": 66420,
      "end_ms": 69775,
      "text": "当时高层倾向于用飞机投掷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00027",
      "start_ms": 70120,
      "end_ms": 71605,
      "text": "觉得更接近实战。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00028",
      "start_ms": 72330,
      "end_ms": 75345,
      "text": "但陈开甲在黑板上反复推演后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00029",
      "start_ms": 75720,
      "end_ms": 76955,
      "text": "拍了桌子不行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00030",
      "start_ms": 77380,
      "end_ms": 79165,
      "text": "必须用百米高塔爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00031",
      "start_ms": 80080,
      "end_ms": 81215,
      "text": "他的理由很简单，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00032",
      "start_ms": 82020,
      "end_ms": 84055,
      "text": "飞机投掷偏差太大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00033",
      "start_ms": 84770,
      "end_ms": 86535,
      "text": "一旦数据采集失败，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00034",
      "start_ms": 87060,
      "end_ms": 87580,
      "text": "几年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00035",
      "start_ms": 87680,
      "end_ms": 89045,
      "text": "心血全白费。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00036",
      "start_ms": 89890,
      "end_ms": 91045,
      "text": "国家这么穷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00037",
      "start_ms": 91460,
      "end_ms": 93235,
      "text": "做一次试验不容易，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00038",
      "start_ms": 93590,
      "end_ms": 96030,
      "text": "每一个数据都得拿命去换，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00039",
      "start_ms": 96470,
      "end_ms": 98075,
      "text": "容不得半点闪失。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00040",
      "start_ms": 98830,
      "end_ms": 100585,
      "text": "争论最激烈的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00041",
      "start_ms": 100880,
      "end_ms": 103855,
      "text": "他敢跟基地司令员当面拍桌子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00042",
      "start_ms": 104650,
      "end_ms": 105575,
      "text": "有人劝他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00043",
      "start_ms": 105930,
      "end_ms": 106945,
      "text": "领导都定了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00044",
      "start_ms": 107490,
      "end_ms": 108190,
      "text": "你叫什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00045",
      "start_ms": 108190,
      "end_ms": 109715,
      "text": "真陈开甲说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00046",
      "start_ms": 110800,
      "end_ms": 112905,
      "text": "我不管他是不是司令员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00047",
      "start_ms": 113480,
      "end_ms": 115725,
      "text": "我只看他讲不讲科学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00048",
      "start_ms": 116020,
      "end_ms": 119805,
      "text": "我是怕国家的事业在我手里出半分差错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00049",
      "start_ms": 120720,
      "end_ms": 123370,
      "text": "最终高层采纳了他的方案。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00050",
      "start_ms": 123370,
      "end_ms": 124650,
      "text": "一百零二米高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00051",
      "start_ms": 124650,
      "end_ms": 126675,
      "text": "铁塔爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00052",
      "start_ms": 128220,
      "end_ms": 129985,
      "text": "一九六四年十月十六日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00053",
      "start_ms": 130410,
      "end_ms": 132985,
      "text": "罗布泊上空一声巨响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00054",
      "start_ms": 133430,
      "end_ms": 135265,
      "text": "蘑菇云腾空而起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00055",
      "start_ms": 135780,
      "end_ms": 137455,
      "text": "因为坚持了塔报方案，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00056",
      "start_ms": 138060,
      "end_ms": 144445,
      "text": "程开甲带队研制的一千七百多台测试仪器全部拿到了完整数据。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00057",
      "start_ms": 145070,
      "end_ms": 146375,
      "text": "这个成果有多牛？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00058",
      "start_ms": 147410,
      "end_ms": 150335,
      "text": "法国第一次核试验没拿到任何数据，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00059",
      "start_ms": 151280,
      "end_ms": 155510,
      "text": "美国、英国苏联第一次也只拿到很少一部分。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00060",
      "start_ms": 155510,
      "end_ms": 162255,
      "text": "而中国第一次就全部拿到了蘑菇云升起来的那一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00061",
      "start_ms": 163120,
      "end_ms": 164595,
      "text": "所有人都在欢呼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00062",
      "start_ms": 165610,
      "end_ms": 166685,
      "text": "陈开甲笑了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00063",
      "start_ms": 167460,
      "end_ms": 169155,
      "text": "但他的脑子没停下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00064",
      "start_ms": 169980,
      "end_ms": 171255,
      "text": "气还没喘匀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00065",
      "start_ms": 171830,
      "end_ms": 173825,
      "text": "他又扎进了清弹的研究里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00066",
      "start_ms": 174700,
      "end_ms": 175365,
      "text": "说到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00067",
      "start_ms": 176140,
      "end_ms": 177695,
      "text": "我得给你讲个小插曲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00068",
      "start_ms": 178540,
      "end_ms": 180955,
      "text": "你就知道这个人疯到什么程度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00069",
      "start_ms": 182090,
      "end_ms": 184465,
      "text": "有一次在研究所食堂排队打饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00070",
      "start_ms": 185050,
      "end_ms": 186365,
      "text": "轮到城开甲了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00071",
      "start_ms": 186790,
      "end_ms": 188895,
      "text": "他把饭票递进窗口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00072",
      "start_ms": 189330,
      "end_ms": 192485,
      "text": "眼睛直勾勾盯着师傅手里的勺子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00073",
      "start_ms": 192980,
      "end_ms": 194680,
      "text": "嘴里一本正经的说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00074",
      "start_ms": 194800,
      "end_ms": 196045,
      "text": "我给你这个数据，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00075",
      "start_ms": 196470,
      "end_ms": 197525,
      "text": "你验算一下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00076",
      "start_ms": 198080,
      "end_ms": 200285,
      "text": "食堂师傅拿着饭票愣在那儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00077",
      "start_ms": 200560,
      "end_ms": 204375,
      "text": "一脸蒙圈儿排在后面的邓稼先实在忍不住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00078",
      "start_ms": 204690,
      "end_ms": 206125,
      "text": "扑哧一声笑出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00079",
      "start_ms": 206460,
      "end_ms": 207805,
      "text": "拍着他的肩膀说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00080",
      "start_ms": 208730,
      "end_ms": 212790,
      "text": "老城这儿是食堂程开甲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00081",
      "start_ms": 212850,
      "end_ms": 214275,
      "text": "这才如梦初醒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00082",
      "start_ms": 214630,
      "end_ms": 216465,
      "text": "不好意思的挠头道歉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00083",
      "start_ms": 217450,
      "end_ms": 218575,
      "text": "这不是段子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00084",
      "start_ms": 219420,
      "end_ms": 220375,
      "text": "这是真事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00085",
      "start_ms": 221490,
      "end_ms": 224025,
      "text": "一个把自己活成了数据的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00086",
      "start_ms": 224570,
      "end_ms": 225625,
      "text": "你说他疯不疯？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00087",
      "start_ms": 226370,
      "end_ms": 230700,
      "text": "但真正让所有人红了眼眶的是另一件事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00088",
      "start_ms": 230840,
      "end_ms": 233545,
      "text": "一次地下河试验爆炸成功后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00089",
      "start_ms": 234050,
      "end_ms": 236190,
      "text": "众人欢呼雀跃的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00090",
      "start_ms": 236430,
      "end_ms": 240345,
      "text": "程开甲做了一个让所有人都吓傻的决定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00091",
      "start_ms": 240900,
      "end_ms": 244225,
      "text": "他要亲自钻进爆炸中心的坑道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00092",
      "start_ms": 244690,
      "end_ms": 246115,
      "text": "收集第一手资料。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00093",
      "start_ms": 246650,
      "end_ms": 251685,
      "text": "那条坑道被核爆的冲击力挤压到直径不到八十厘米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00094",
      "start_ms": 252220,
      "end_ms": 253195,
      "text": "刚报答完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00095",
      "start_ms": 253570,
      "end_ms": 258455,
      "text": "里面全是致命的放射性危害探测笔一直在响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00096",
      "start_ms": 258920,
      "end_ms": 260145,
      "text": "警报声刺耳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00097",
      "start_ms": 260510,
      "end_ms": 262895,
      "text": "而且坑道随时可能坍塌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00098",
      "start_ms": 263700,
      "end_ms": 265195,
      "text": "身边的人都急了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00099",
      "start_ms": 266310,
      "end_ms": 268720,
      "text": "手掌您不能去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00100",
      "start_ms": 268860,
      "end_ms": 269695,
      "text": "太危险了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00101",
      "start_ms": 269990,
      "end_ms": 272565,
      "text": "我们年轻人去陈凯甲一把拦住他们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00102",
      "start_ms": 272890,
      "end_ms": 273935,
      "text": "只说了八个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00103",
      "start_ms": 274290,
      "end_ms": 276605,
      "text": "不入虎穴焉得虎子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00104",
      "start_ms": 277580,
      "end_ms": 278000,
      "text": "说完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00105",
      "start_ms": 278240,
      "end_ms": 279600,
      "text": "他穿上防护服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00106",
      "start_ms": 279960,
      "end_ms": 283905,
      "text": "第一个钻进了那条不到八十厘米宽的坑道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00107",
      "start_ms": 284520,
      "end_ms": 290855,
      "text": "在高温、高放射性随时可能坍塌的坑道里匍匐前进，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00108",
      "start_ms": 291250,
      "end_ms": 293130,
      "text": "一步一步爬向爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00109",
      "start_ms": 293130,
      "end_ms": 295070,
      "text": "中心出来的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00110",
      "start_ms": 295210,
      "end_ms": 296370,
      "text": "他浑身是汗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00111",
      "start_ms": 296710,
      "end_ms": 298055,
      "text": "脸上全是灰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00112",
      "start_ms": 298680,
      "end_ms": 299695,
      "text": "警卫员问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00113",
      "start_ms": 300680,
      "end_ms": 301385,
      "text": "首长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00114",
      "start_ms": 302230,
      "end_ms": 303145,
      "text": "您不怕吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00115",
      "start_ms": 303470,
      "end_ms": 303775,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00116",
      "start_ms": 304380,
      "end_ms": 305660,
      "text": "程铠甲淡定的说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00117",
      "start_ms": 305740,
      "end_ms": 306145,
      "text": "怕。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00118",
      "start_ms": 308030,
      "end_ms": 311170,
      "text": "但我更怕祖国的试验有什么闪失？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00119",
      "start_ms": 312370,
      "end_ms": 318570,
      "text": "这句话比任何豪言壮语都重在罗布泊的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00120",
      "start_ms": 318570,
      "end_ms": 319490,
      "text": "二十多年里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00121",
      "start_ms": 319990,
      "end_ms": 323450,
      "text": "程开甲参与主持了三十多次核试验，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00122",
      "start_ms": 323990,
      "end_ms": 325710,
      "text": "从原子弹到氢弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00123",
      "start_ms": 326090,
      "end_ms": 328890,
      "text": "从地面爆炸到地下数井。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00124",
      "start_ms": 329330,
      "end_ms": 331170,
      "text": "每一次都很成功，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00125",
      "start_ms": 331810,
      "end_ms": 333790,
      "text": "他被称为中国核试令，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00126",
      "start_ms": 334050,
      "end_ms": 337655,
      "text": "是中国参与核试验次数最多的科学家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00127",
      "start_ms": 338280,
      "end_ms": 339120,
      "text": "可你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00128",
      "start_ms": 339920,
      "end_ms": 341220,
      "text": "这二十多年里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00129",
      "start_ms": 341740,
      "end_ms": 345960,
      "text": "他把生活的重担全留给了妻子高耀山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00130",
      "start_ms": 346880,
      "end_ms": 349660,
      "text": "他穿着带补丁的旧军衣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00131",
      "start_ms": 349800,
      "end_ms": 353200,
      "text": "扛着铁锹和家属们一起开荒种地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00132",
      "start_ms": 353440,
      "end_ms": 355880,
      "text": "种萝卜、土豆、大白菜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00133",
      "start_ms": 356240,
      "end_ms": 360440,
      "text": "把家里的事儿全包了让程开甲一门心思搞实验，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00134",
      "start_ms": 360900,
      "end_ms": 362760,
      "text": "而他满脑子都是数据，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00135",
      "start_ms": 363220,
      "end_ms": 366960,
      "text": "连妻子什么时候白了头都没注意到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00136",
      "start_ms": 367420,
      "end_ms": 368945,
      "text": "直到一九九九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00137",
      "start_ms": 369260,
      "end_ms": 374155,
      "text": "国家授予二十三名科学家两弹一星功勋奖章，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00138",
      "start_ms": 374570,
      "end_ms": 377455,
      "text": "隐姓埋名四十年的陈开家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00139",
      "start_ms": 378090,
      "end_ms": 381375,
      "text": "这个名字才重新出现在公众面前。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00140",
      "start_ms": 382250,
      "end_ms": 383465,
      "text": "人们这才知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00141",
      "start_ms": 384300,
      "end_ms": 386555,
      "text": "这位满头白发的老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00142",
      "start_ms": 386930,
      "end_ms": 391430,
      "text": "是中国唯一一位及其六大最高荣誉的科学家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00143",
      "start_ms": 391590,
      "end_ms": 400905,
      "text": "中国科学院院士、两弹一星功勋奖章、国家最高科学技术奖八一勋章改革先锋称号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00144",
      "start_ms": 401550,
      "end_ms": 404940,
      "text": "人民科学家、国家荣誉称号六大荣誉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00145",
      "start_ms": 405180,
      "end_ms": 406725,
      "text": "给予一人之身，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00146",
      "start_ms": 407210,
      "end_ms": 408155,
      "text": "前无古人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00147",
      "start_ms": 409470,
      "end_ms": 411495,
      "text": "二零一八年十一月十七日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00148",
      "start_ms": 412220,
      "end_ms": 413260,
      "text": "程凯甲病逝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00149",
      "start_ms": 413560,
      "end_ms": 415015,
      "text": "享年一百零一岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00150",
      "start_ms": 415900,
      "end_ms": 416935,
      "text": "他来的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00151",
      "start_ms": 417570,
      "end_ms": 419095,
      "text": "中国山河破碎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00152",
      "start_ms": 420090,
      "end_ms": 421155,
      "text": "被人看不起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00153",
      "start_ms": 422420,
      "end_ms": 423605,
      "text": "他走的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00154",
      "start_ms": 424070,
      "end_ms": 425330,
      "text": "中国国富民强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00155",
      "start_ms": 425690,
      "end_ms": 427925,
      "text": "再也没人敢随便欺负。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00156",
      "start_ms": 428520,
      "end_ms": 428940,
      "text": "程老。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00157",
      "start_ms": 428940,
      "end_ms": 430160,
      "text": "生前说过一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00158",
      "start_ms": 430220,
      "end_ms": 437935,
      "text": "我这辈子最大的幸福就是自己所做的一切都和祖国紧紧的联系在一起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00159",
      "start_ms": 438770,
      "end_ms": 440390,
      "text": "他本可以留在英国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00160",
      "start_ms": 440730,
      "end_ms": 441630,
      "text": "穿着西装，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00161",
      "start_ms": 441870,
      "end_ms": 444735,
      "text": "喝着咖啡走学术的坦途，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00162",
      "start_ms": 445350,
      "end_ms": 447955,
      "text": "但他选择了在大漠里喝风吃沙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00163",
      "start_ms": 448370,
      "end_ms": 450115,
      "text": "隐姓埋名四十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00164",
      "start_ms": 450610,
      "end_ms": 454525,
      "text": "他本可以名扬四海享受鲜花和掌声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00165",
      "start_ms": 455070,
      "end_ms": 457395,
      "text": "但他选择了把名字埋进黄沙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00166",
      "start_ms": 457880,
      "end_ms": 460065,
      "text": "连家人都不知道他在干什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00167",
      "start_ms": 460820,
      "end_ms": 461715,
      "text": "有人说他傻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00168",
      "start_ms": 462250,
      "end_ms": 463495,
      "text": "可正是这种傻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00169",
      "start_ms": 464010,
      "end_ms": 466310,
      "text": "撑起了我们今天的腰杆子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00170",
      "start_ms": 466450,
      "end_ms": 469930,
      "text": "我们今天能安安稳稳坐在家里看手机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00171",
      "start_ms": 470290,
      "end_ms": 471855,
      "text": "吃饭睡觉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00172",
      "start_ms": 472340,
      "end_ms": 473820,
      "text": "不用看别人脸色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00173",
      "start_ms": 474100,
      "end_ms": 476955,
      "text": "不用怕别人的军舰开到家门口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00174",
      "start_ms": 477310,
      "end_ms": 482145,
      "text": "有多少是程开甲和他的战友们拿命换来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00175",
      "start_ms": 482370,
      "end_ms": 483365,
      "text": "记住这个名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00176",
      "start_ms": 484890,
      "end_ms": 485665,
      "text": "程开甲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00177",
      "start_ms": 487170,
      "end_ms": 490225,
      "text": "中国核司令共和国的脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00178",
      "start_ms": 491180,
      "end_ms": 491800,
      "text": "说到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00179",
      "start_ms": 491800,
      "end_ms": 492965,
      "text": "我想多说一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00180",
      "start_ms": 493400,
      "end_ms": 497485,
      "text": "程开甲只是千千万万国事中的一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00181",
      "start_ms": 498020,
      "end_ms": 500705,
      "text": "那些把名字埋进黄沙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00182",
      "start_ms": 501170,
      "end_ms": 503255,
      "text": "拿命换国家安定的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00183",
      "start_ms": 503660,
      "end_ms": 506290,
      "text": "他们的故事真的不该被遗忘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00184",
      "start_ms": 506410,
      "end_ms": 514035,
      "text": "这套国之脊梁里面写了包括程开甲在内的四十多位中国科学家的真实人生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00185",
      "start_ms": 514940,
      "end_ms": 517545,
      "text": "不是那种喊口号的人物简介，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00186",
      "start_ms": 517950,
      "end_ms": 524125,
      "text": "是真的把他们受的苦冒的险做的选择一装一件写出来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00187",
      "start_ms": 525060,
      "end_ms": 526060,
      "text": "我自己看的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00188",
      "start_ms": 526060,
      "end_ms": 527625,
      "text": "好几次没忍住眼泪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00189",
      "start_ms": 527950,
      "end_ms": 530770,
      "text": "尤其是家里有孩子的真，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00190",
      "start_ms": 530770,
      "end_ms": 532025,
      "text": "该让孩子读读，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00191",
      "start_ms": 532400,
      "end_ms": 533455,
      "text": "在大漠里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00192",
      "start_ms": 533890,
      "end_ms": 534825,
      "text": "在实验室里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00193",
      "start_ms": 535130,
      "end_ms": 538035,
      "text": "在生死线上拿命给我们铺路的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00194",
      "start_ms": 538540,
      "end_ms": 541245,
      "text": "书就在视频左下角链接里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00195",
      "start_ms": 541790,
      "end_ms": 543430,
      "text": "感兴趣的朋友可以带回家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00196",
      "start_ms": 543610,
      "end_ms": 544510,
      "text": "细细品读。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00197",
      "start_ms": 544750,
      "end_ms": 546955,
      "text": "如果你也被程老的故事打动了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00198",
      "start_ms": 547270,
      "end_ms": 548170,
      "text": "请点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00199",
      "start_ms": 548350,
      "end_ms": 550765,
      "text": "把这条视频转发出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00200",
      "start_ms": 551160,
      "end_ms": 555260,
      "text": "让更多人知道谁才是我们最该追的星。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00201",
      "start_ms": 555440,
      "end_ms": 556420,
      "text": "评论区告诉我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00202",
      "start_ms": 556680,
      "end_ms": 559125,
      "text": "程老的哪个瞬间最戳你的心？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00203",
      "start_ms": 559490,
      "end_ms": 560330,
      "text": "收藏起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00204",
      "start_ms": 560510,
      "end_ms": 561430,
      "text": "讲给你的孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00205",
      "start_ms": 561430,
      "end_ms": 563315,
      "text": "听关注我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00206",
      "start_ms": 563690,
      "end_ms": 565170,
      "text": "下一期继续讲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_29b87f19019347e7_s00207",
      "start_ms": 565170,
      "end_ms": 567455,
      "text": "那些不该被遗忘的国事。"
    }
  ],
